```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App
    participant EFS Standard
    participant EFS IA (Infrequent Access)
    
    User->>App: Upload File
    App->>EFS Standard: Write Data
    
    Note over EFS Standard, EFS IA: 30 days pass with no access
    
    EFS Standard->>EFS IA: Lifecycle Policy automatically moves file
    
    Note over EFS Standard, EFS IA: File remains in same namespace
    
    User->>App: Request File
    App->>EFS IA: Transparently read from IA tier
```
